taking pictures with people.

00:06:15.832 --> 00:06:17.798
- Right, so listen,
that's his prerogative.

00:06:17.798 --> 00:06:19.649
I do believe that if
you're lucky enough to make

00:06:19.649 --> 00:06:22.766
