things that you should,

00:06:24.804 --> 00:06:27.127
I think if a fan wants the selfie

00:06:27.127 --> 00:06:28.745
that you should deliver on that.

00:06:28.745 --> 00:06:31.643
But, that's just one
humble man's point of view.

00:06:31.643 --> 00:06:34.034
I have tons of empathy
if you're introverted

00:06:34.034 --> 00:06:36.059
or you don't like it,

00:06:36.059 --> 00:06:39.384
but to me, the fan is always right.

00:06:39.384 --> 00:06:42.392
And a fan wants a signed
book, if they want a picture,

00:06:42.392 --> 00:06:44.344
if they want a handshake, if
they just want to thank me,

00:06:44.344 --> 00:06:47.432
if they want to give me their book,

00:06:47.432 --> 00:06:50.031
I'm just very thankful
they want to do anything.

00:06:50.031 --> 00:06:52.387
And so for me, I'm most
comfortable in counterpunching,

00:06:52.387 --> 00:06:55.959
reverse engineering, the finish
line for the other person.

00:06:55.959 --> 00:06:57.763
But I can't be mad at
somebody drawing lines

00:06:57.763 --> 00:07:00.381
because, I mean, he may be a germaphobe.

00:07:00.381 --> 00:07:01.913
Oh, but he says he shakes hands.

00:07:01.913 --> 00:07:03.164
Everybody's got their own thing.

00:07:03.164 --> 00:07:05.042
